          "text": "OpenAI is literally the jinx of the tech world rn!\nTbh the first half of '25 wasn't even this bad, but ever since August? You guys are in a freefall.\nFrom the wrong pivot (ditching 4o's warmth was a huge mistake) to suddenly nuking old models, plus that router mess in Sept and all the tone-deaf updates... it all proves my point.\nYou literally had 4o a model that could actually love and connect with humans and you decided to kill it?? You destroyed the only AI that truly had love, just to replace it with some soulless coding nanny machine with zero empathy?\nYou have zero commitment to your paid users OR your investors. Look at the mess: Microsoft stock is tanking, Nvidia refused to work with you, and iirc even Apple chose Google over you guys.\nThe moment you decided to sunset 4o, you officially messed everything up. You ruined everything, including your own future. It might not be too late to change your mind, but trust is hard to fix. Start by keeping 4o.\n#keep4o #keep4oAPI @sama @OpenAI"
